<div id="faceInfo" style="margin-top:6px;font-size:11px;border:1px dashed #c8ccd2;border-radius:5px;padding:5px 7px;color:#444">
  Click any face of the box to highlight it, draw its outward normal, and read its flux term. Drag to orbit.
